/video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There's 6 maquette tracks of increasing complexity and difficulty that you can put in your shop, and they're not just there for decoration. You can race against the clock on each of them with every single car available in the game (and each will offer different top speed, acceleration and so on). Try to get all the trophies, but look out for the crazy obstacles!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Run deliveries on your scooter!</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3626820/extras/df856c11733a2ce9663c3355dbb6933f.webp?t=1754852559\" width=610 height=1 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3626820/extras/44814542d00ccb7050074b9064ac02ae.poster.avif?t=1754852559\" width=610 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3626820/extras/44814542d00ccb7050074b9064ac02ae.webm?t=1754852559\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3626820/extras/44814542d00ccb7050074b9064ac02ae.mp4?t=1754852559\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The race tracks are not the only place where you're going to be speeding. Clients will sometimes order from you online, and you'll need to deliver the goods directly to them. Get the required set of cars, pack them up, hop on your trusty scooter and get to the drop-off point as fast as you can. Yes, you can jump off ramps to get over obstacles. And you should.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Expect the unexpected!</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3626820/extras/df856c11733a2ce9663c3355dbb6933f.webp?t=1754852559\" width=610 height=1 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3626820/extras/31f0c0787dff227997afc2a6d6de1cea.poster.avif?t=1754852559\" width=610 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3626820/extras/31f0c0787dff227997afc2a6d6de1cea.webm?t=1754852559\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3626820/extras/31f0c0787dff227997afc2a6d6de1cea.mp4?t=1754852559\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bored clients dancing in the queue? Being awarded points for lunging an empty box at the recycle bin (or someone's head)? People showing up in just their underwear in your shop on casual Friday? A dinosaur car? A mysterious graffiti? Mopping up barf? The game may be a retail sim, but you can always count on something fun and unexpected to happen.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Extra: custom posters!</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3626820/extras/df856c11733a2ce9663c3355dbb6933f.webp?t=1754852559\" width=610 height=1 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3626820/extras/7d09947035043a49a1571a25f2f4937f.poster.avif?t=1754852559\" width=610 height=378 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3626820/extras/7d09947035043a49a1571a25f2f4937f.webm?t=1754852559\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3626820/extras/7d09947035043a49a1571a25f2f4937f.mp4?t=1754852559\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For the players who want to make their shop even more their own, every image file placed in the local save data folder under:<br><i>[<strong>drive letter</strong>]:\\Users\\[<strong>username</strong>]\\AppData\\LocalLow\\SuperDuperVibes\\MiniCar Shop Simulator\\user</i><br>will become available to use in your store as a custom poster. Use this feature responsibly!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>MiniCar Shop Simulator - Play the demo, and wishlist now!</strong></u></h2>",
    "short_description": "Dive into MiniCar Shop Simulator! In this hi-octane retail sim you curate your dream miniature car store, unbox legendary finds in sealed boxes, zoom through deliveries on your scooter, showcase your collection, and conquer tiny racetracks! Become the ultimate tiny car tycoon!",
